    },
    "月額" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monthly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "月額・年額は、期間が終わる 24 時間前までに解約しないかぎり、自動で更新されます。解約は、設定アプリの Apple Account の「サブスクリプション」からできます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monthly and yearly plans renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the period ends. You can cancel under Subscriptions in your Apple Account in the Settings app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "案内を閉じる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
